{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a single-player third-person tower defense game that masterfully combines classic strategy with immersive action gameplay. Players can build defensive towers to repel enemies or step onto the battlefield to face monsters directly. By pressing the 'C' key, you can freely switch between perspectives\u2014engage in the fray with a third-person view or oversee your defenses from a tactical overhead angle. When you're ready, click 'START WAVE' in overhead mode to begin spawning monsters, launching the battle on your terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game also includes a character showcase feature, allowing you to view your hero\u2019s simple actions\u2014like running or standing\u2014in detail. This unique blend of strategy and combat offers a fresh and exciting take on the tower defense genre!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516920/extras/newControl.jpg?t=1743959718\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516920?t=1743959718","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516920/91866fe1ec805a138d0188b08734660f92353118/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743959718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516920/b7a83d0cf5d12921a798d786dea83a2ce2944a1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743959718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516920/b7a83d0cf5d12921a798d786dea83a2ce2944a1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743959718","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3619440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a single-player third-person tower defense game that masterfully combines classic strat